  - Your parents did it, mine did too.
  - Thats just how marriage work.
  - Why change?
  - ...
  - Are you going to be happy here?
  - I wont be able to see you as much.
  - Just so you know.
  - But i hear the facilities here are top class.
  - They have a buffet for lunch on saturdays,
  - 'And you can go to water yoga once a month. '
  - ...
  - Take me back.
  - I really feel it would be best for both of us.
